WEBVTT

00:03.130 --> 00:06.500
The winged knights are humans who have
awakened as heroes that can grow stronger

00:06.500 --> 00:08.420
each time they are resurrected.

00:08.420 --> 00:12.420
Given enough time, they will undoubtedly become
a tremendous threat to the demon realm.

00:12.710 --> 00:14.790
With that in mind,

00:14.790 --> 00:17.670
Azudra comes up with a two-prong strategy
to solidify the defenses at Castle Urum

00:17.670 --> 00:22.420
while also gathering an elite unit of warriors
who will assassinate the Human King.

00:26.040 --> 00:27.000
Here!

00:29.790 --> 00:31.460
What was that paper you just threw in?

00:31.710 --> 00:33.000
I dunno!

01:00.420 --> 01:02.710
Kurui dashita haguruma ga

01:02.710 --> 01:05.380
Kanakirigoe de sakendeiru

01:05.380 --> 01:07.380
Hibana o chirasu unmei

01:07.380 --> 01:10.210
Moeagaru suki o ukagau mitai

01:10.460 --> 01:12.540
Yabai card hikiateta

01:12.540 --> 01:15.170
Pinch no toki koso chance da

01:15.170 --> 01:17.080
Mada akiramete nanka nai

01:17.080 --> 01:19.960
Saigo made tatsu mono ga shousha da

01:20.170 --> 01:22.330
Hohoemi kakeru akuma

01:22.330 --> 01:25.080
To te o toriatte odorou

01:25.080 --> 01:27.330
Narifuri kamau koto wa nai

01:27.330 --> 01:29.670
Gekijou ni yuragu ketsui

01:29.670 --> 01:32.630
Yami ni nomarete shimau mae ni

01:32.830 --> 01:33.500
Break it

01:33.500 --> 01:35.000
Keriagero

01:35.000 --> 01:38.080
Kudakechiru no wa kimi no joushiki da

01:38.080 --> 01:42.580
Dare ni mo makenai honoo kokoro ni daite

01:42.880 --> 01:48.330
Ima hateshinai sekai ni sasageru kono inori ga

01:48.330 --> 01:53.080
Kanau asu ga kuru made taeru koto naku

01:53.080 --> 01:54.710
Moyashi tsuzukeru

01:54.710 --> 01:57.580
It's my soul

02:04.960 --> 02:09.880
<b>Back to the Continent</b>

02:12.290 --> 02:13.830
Where could it be?

02:13.830 --> 02:15.130
To the right! To the right!

02:15.500 --> 02:17.420
Where could it be?

02:17.420 --> 02:18.580
To the left! To the left!

02:19.420 --> 02:20.750
Go up! Go up!

02:20.750 --> 02:21.580
Up?

02:22.580 --> 02:23.920
Where could it be?

02:25.420 --> 02:28.670
So as a fellow human,
I want to put an end to their rampage.

02:30.170 --> 02:30.960
Where is it?

02:30.960 --> 02:31.580
I've got to hand it to Helck.

02:31.580 --> 02:32.460
I've got to hand it to Helck.
I'm not telling you!<b></b>

02:32.460 --> 02:34.250
To think that he was shouldering
such a heavy burden...

02:34.250 --> 02:34.880
To think that he was shouldering
such a heavy burden...
Is it over here?<b></b>

02:34.880 --> 02:35.580
Is it over here?

02:35.580 --> 02:36.540
Not saying!

02:36.540 --> 02:38.130
Maybe over here?

02:38.880 --> 02:40.210
It's strange.
I'm not telling you!<b></b>

02:40.630 --> 02:41.500
Not long ago Helck just looked
incredibly dubious and sinister to me.

02:41.500 --> 02:42.500
Not long ago Helck just looked
incredibly dubious and sinister to me.
Is it here?<b></b>

02:42.500 --> 02:43.080
Not long ago Helck just looked
incredibly dubious and sinister to me.

02:43.080 --> 02:44.040
Not saying!

02:44.040 --> 02:46.630
But after hearing that story,
it's like I'm seeing him in a new light.

02:48.790 --> 02:52.000
A situation so bad that you have no choice
but to turn on your own friends...

02:52.880 --> 02:54.630
I hate to even think about it.

02:57.080 --> 02:58.420
It must be over there!

03:02.540 --> 03:04.920
I swear those little guys
will end up hurt sooner or later.

03:05.630 --> 03:07.670
Hey, Annie!

03:07.670 --> 03:10.130
Oh jeez, how many times
do I have to tell you no nicknames...

03:10.130 --> 03:11.750
The Great Witch has arrived, yo!

03:11.750 --> 03:12.670
What?!

03:13.630 --> 03:15.210
In the village? Is she there now?

03:15.540 --> 03:16.460
Yup!

03:16.460 --> 03:19.130
I wuz told to come over here
and letcha know!

03:19.130 --> 03:20.750
That's great! Thank you!

03:20.750 --> 03:21.880
No prob!

03:22.080 --> 03:22.960
Oh, uh...

03:22.960 --> 03:26.170
I'm going on ahead to the village,
so please let Helck know too!

03:27.000 --> 03:27.790
Sure.

03:28.210 --> 03:30.830
Our greatest hope
of getting back to the continent!

03:32.380 --> 03:33.460
What?

03:33.460 --> 03:35.460
She already went back home?!

03:35.460 --> 03:37.580
It's cuz ya took yer sweet time
getting here, Annie.

03:37.580 --> 03:38.210
Huh?!

03:38.420 --> 03:41.210
I tried my best to delay her, ya know.

03:41.330 --> 03:42.580
No way.

03:42.580 --> 03:44.460
I rushed here as soon as I heard!

03:44.790 --> 03:49.000
Dammit... I never imagined
that I was actually such a slowpoke!

03:49.960 --> 03:51.080
Oh, shucks.

03:51.830 --> 03:53.540
So she already went home?

03:53.540 --> 03:54.630
Helck!

03:55.130 --> 03:57.380
I'm sorry, it's my fault...

03:57.380 --> 04:00.960
It turns out that I'm slower than a snail
when it comes to running!

04:00.960 --> 04:02.380
That's not it!

04:02.880 --> 04:05.880
I got all pooped out on my way
to come tell you the news!

04:05.880 --> 04:07.830
And so I took a little snooze!

04:07.830 --> 04:08.750
Snooze?

04:08.750 --> 04:09.920
I'm sorry!

04:12.040 --> 04:14.380
You really stay true to yourself, huh?

04:15.630 --> 04:17.750
Well, don't worry about it too much!

04:17.750 --> 04:21.750
I told the Great Witch
about y'all and yer situation!

04:21.750 --> 04:24.000
And she said she'd be
more than happy to meet with ya!

04:26.000 --> 04:28.460
The Great Witch has
already nullified her barrier!

04:28.460 --> 04:30.380
So y'all can go and pay her a visit anytime!

04:30.380 --> 04:33.170
Oh, that's great!
I knew we could count on you, Chief!

04:33.170 --> 04:34.330
Thank you!

04:35.130 --> 04:36.210
What a relief.

04:36.210 --> 04:38.080
All right!
Let's go and see her immediately!

04:38.250 --> 04:40.670
If we dillydally for too long,
the sun will go down!

04:40.670 --> 04:42.080
You're right.

04:42.080 --> 04:42.920
Piwi!

04:42.920 --> 04:45.130
Do me a favor and show these folks
how to get there, okay?

04:45.420 --> 04:46.460
Okay!

04:46.460 --> 04:47.750
Thanks for your help.

04:47.750 --> 04:48.880
Sure thing!

04:49.130 --> 04:51.290
So that's the fuzzball's name...

04:56.000 --> 04:58.380
This place is pretty far from the village, huh?

04:58.710 --> 04:59.880
Yep!

05:06.880 --> 05:09.670
The continent still isn't even visible
even from way up here.

05:10.380 --> 05:12.880
There's nothing but ocean
as far as the eye can see...

05:16.790 --> 05:19.880
Despite his ability to cast all those spells
that seem like rule-breaking miracles,

05:19.880 --> 05:22.290
I suppose even Azudra is powerless
to do much about this.

05:22.790 --> 05:26.960
What does the Great Witch
spend her time doing up here every day?

05:26.960 --> 05:29.000
Research and inventing!

05:29.710 --> 05:32.420
She gets super mad
when anybody gets in her way!

05:32.420 --> 05:33.580
It's so scary!

05:33.580 --> 05:35.670
Then I guess we better be careful.

05:35.670 --> 05:39.330
I just hope this witch lady knows
which direction leads to the continent.

05:39.330 --> 05:42.540
Because if she doesn't,
then we're just going to have to rely on luck.

05:43.750 --> 05:45.000
Can we even get back?

05:45.000 --> 05:47.580
It doesn't matter.
We HAVE to find our way back regardless.

05:47.580 --> 05:51.130
Because there are still a mountain
of things that I must do upon our return!

05:51.130 --> 05:52.250
There it is!

05:53.130 --> 05:54.580
That's her house!

05:59.080 --> 06:02.500
Wh-what the hell?
I'm sensing a monstrous power.

06:02.880 --> 06:05.130
And it's so formidable
that I can hardly believe it's coming

06:05.130 --> 06:06.750
from a resident of this island!

06:13.210 --> 06:14.830
Such a powerful spell.

06:14.830 --> 06:16.750
We're not dealing with any ordinary person!

06:20.880 --> 06:23.290
H-hello there!

06:23.880 --> 06:26.290
The vibe around here
is different from everywhere else.

06:26.290 --> 06:30.710
She's a friend of the villagers.
There shouldn't be much to worry about...

06:30.880 --> 06:33.000
but for some reason this puts me on edge.

06:33.000 --> 06:34.710
Coming.

06:42.420 --> 06:44.170
NO FRIGGIN' WAY!

06:44.880 --> 06:46.080
Hello there!

06:47.210 --> 06:48.420
So big!

06:48.420 --> 06:50.170
This is not what I was expecting!

06:50.170 --> 06:51.750
But wait, it makes sense!

06:51.750 --> 06:53.210
I'm definitely picking up on a mysterious aura.

06:53.210 --> 06:54.750
Hello there!
I'm definitely picking up on a mysterious aura.<b></b>

06:55.040 --> 06:57.000
This must be the witch!

06:57.170 --> 06:59.380
Wrong, silly billy.

07:02.420 --> 07:03.830
Welcome.

07:04.130 --> 07:05.500
Glad you made it.

07:11.040 --> 07:12.920
Hello there, old hag!

07:12.920 --> 07:14.790
Yes, hello there.

07:14.790 --> 07:17.170
She's not exactly a grandma, is she?

07:17.330 --> 07:19.210
You see, this little one found a book

07:19.210 --> 07:22.290
with an illustration
of an elderly woman who resembles me.

07:22.290 --> 07:26.460
And now has become very partial to
addressing me as "old hag" for that reason.

07:26.460 --> 07:27.540
But...

07:28.880 --> 07:31.580
I seem to recall telling you
that "old hag" was a taboo phrase.

07:33.380 --> 07:35.380
No!

07:37.540 --> 07:39.500
Help me!

07:41.630 --> 07:43.500
I'm sorry!

07:45.080 --> 07:47.710
You gotta save me, Annie!

07:49.250 --> 07:52.630
I see you've gotten clever enough
to run away, Piwi.

07:53.460 --> 07:55.670
So you are... the Great Witch?

07:56.130 --> 07:58.830
Indeed. I am the Witch you seek.

07:58.830 --> 08:02.170
My apologies for
keeping you waiting for so long.

08:02.500 --> 08:04.790
The Village Chief told me
all about you two.

08:04.790 --> 08:07.500
I understand you wish to know
which direction the continent is.

08:08.170 --> 08:10.670
My name is Helck! Nice to meet you!

08:12.540 --> 08:16.170
Great Witch, I hope you'll be kind enough
to share information with us.

08:16.500 --> 08:19.380
For you see, we have pressing reasons
to get back to the continent.

08:22.250 --> 08:24.170
Very well, then.

08:24.170 --> 08:25.790
I shall tell you.

08:26.580 --> 08:29.790
Since it seems you were generous enough
to help the villagers with a number of things,

08:29.790 --> 08:32.830
I'm willing to lend you my aid
in getting back home.

08:32.830 --> 08:34.670
Wow! Thank you!

08:37.750 --> 08:40.500
The continent that you seek to reach...

08:41.000 --> 08:42.790
lies to the northwest.

08:42.790 --> 08:44.000
Northwest!

08:44.130 --> 08:45.130
This is great!

08:45.130 --> 08:46.960
Anne! Now we can go home!

08:46.960 --> 08:48.080
Let's depart right away!

08:48.500 --> 08:49.830
O-okay...

08:50.710 --> 08:53.000
"The continent that you seek"?

08:53.630 --> 08:55.710
Is she implying there are other continents?

08:56.170 --> 08:57.080
Hold on.

08:57.380 --> 08:59.830
If that's the case, how would she know?

09:01.630 --> 09:03.130
Helck, was it?

09:03.380 --> 09:05.040
I understand how you feel,

09:05.040 --> 09:07.330
but you must not rush so fast
that you leave unprepared.

09:08.380 --> 09:10.750
Knowing how to get to your destination

09:10.750 --> 09:13.330
and arriving there safely
are two different challenges.

09:13.330 --> 09:15.380
You must not take the sea lightly.

09:15.580 --> 09:17.460
Rations, drinking water,

09:17.460 --> 09:21.500
and a sturdy ship that can withstand
the force of storms are necessary.

09:21.880 --> 09:25.040
Your first order of business
should be preparing all of those things.

09:26.460 --> 09:27.920
Is the one that I made okay?

09:28.710 --> 09:32.170
I've never sailed the ocean before,
but I get the feeling that won't cut it...

09:32.330 --> 09:36.460
Well, that shouldn't be much of a problem
if you ask the villagers for help.

09:36.460 --> 09:39.290
The biggest hurdle you face
is catching a Corstag.

09:39.580 --> 09:41.290
"Corstag"?

09:41.420 --> 09:43.960
It's a peculiar creature
that has an innate habit

09:43.960 --> 09:46.290
of traveling between
this island and the continent.

09:46.420 --> 09:49.380
On your way back, there's a troublesome
stretch of ocean to pass through.

09:49.380 --> 09:51.040
It throws magnetic fields out of whack

09:51.040 --> 09:53.330
and is covered in a thick fog
that limits your field of vision,

09:53.330 --> 09:56.290
which means you will undoubtedly
lose your sense of direction.

09:57.540 --> 10:00.580
And that's where the Corstag
will come in handy.

10:00.580 --> 10:02.170
Once you release it into the ocean,

10:02.170 --> 10:04.290
it will start swimming
in the direction of the continent.

10:04.500 --> 10:05.790
I see!

10:05.790 --> 10:08.130
Then we definitely need to find one.

10:08.540 --> 10:10.290
She knows an awful lot about this.

10:11.040 --> 10:14.130
The only problem is
they're very scarce around here.

10:14.130 --> 10:17.080
You will have to be very tenacious
in your search.

10:17.080 --> 10:18.920
Well, it is what it is.

10:18.920 --> 10:21.540
By the way, what does
this creature look like?

10:21.540 --> 10:22.790
Wait just a moment.

10:22.790 --> 10:24.540
I'll fetch a book for you.

10:27.670 --> 10:29.170
I'VE SEEN THIS BEFORE!

10:31.290 --> 10:32.210
Oh!

10:32.210 --> 10:34.290
You caught that when
we went fishing, Anne!

10:34.290 --> 10:36.670
No, you're the one who caught it.

10:36.670 --> 10:39.630
Oh? So you've already encountered one?

10:39.630 --> 10:40.670
Yeah!

10:40.670 --> 10:44.500
In fact, I saw one again this morning
eating seaweed down on the ocean floor.

10:44.500 --> 10:45.880
It might still be in the same spot.

10:45.880 --> 10:48.540
Then you should go look for it
as soon as you can.

10:48.540 --> 10:51.710
Honestly, it's impossible to know
when another one might appear.

10:51.710 --> 10:53.000
Oh no!

10:53.000 --> 10:55.000
Okay, then I'll go search for it right now!

10:55.000 --> 10:57.540
Be careful,
they have poison in their horns.

10:57.540 --> 10:58.540
Understood!

10:58.540 --> 11:00.040
H-hey!

11:00.040 --> 11:02.000
I'm going with you!

11:02.000 --> 11:05.000
Nah! I'll be fine on my own!

11:05.790 --> 11:10.460
Well, he could probably find at least three
of the things without anybody's help...

11:10.460 --> 11:13.380
All right, I suppose it's time
to get ready to eat.

11:13.540 --> 11:15.250
I'll go heat up some water.

11:15.250 --> 11:16.580
I'm gonna help!

11:16.580 --> 11:18.880
Yes, please do.

11:21.670 --> 11:23.960
You should stay here for the night.

11:26.040 --> 11:28.170
It's been forever since my last visitor.

11:28.170 --> 11:29.920
Let me spoil you rotten!

11:29.920 --> 11:32.920
Tell me, who exactly are you?

11:34.580 --> 11:37.420
You're different from anyone else
who lives on the island.

11:37.420 --> 11:41.420
How do you know the direction
of the continent we're trying to get to?

11:41.540 --> 11:44.500
Let me guess, did you used to live
on the same continent...

11:44.790 --> 11:46.670
as a member of the Empire?

11:48.540 --> 11:50.080
That's a secret.

11:50.580 --> 11:51.920
Huh?

11:52.750 --> 11:54.130
Listen, silly billy.

11:54.130 --> 11:57.130
Don't get distracted by frivolous details.

11:57.380 --> 12:00.580
Stay focused on the problems
that are already on your plate.

12:00.580 --> 12:03.080
Th-the problems already on my plate?

12:03.630 --> 12:04.920
Yes.

12:06.170 --> 12:09.500
Naturally, I'm talking about
that Helck fellow.

12:11.880 --> 12:16.750
Trust me, he is someone far more dangerous
than you could ever imagine.

12:25.670 --> 12:27.080
Dangerous?

12:28.040 --> 12:30.130
He's okay for right now.

12:30.580 --> 12:33.540
In fact, I'm sure he'll end up
being a reliable ally.

12:34.000 --> 12:36.920
However, you can't expect that
to be the case forever.

12:38.290 --> 12:41.670
There is a vortex of negative emotions
bottled up inside of him.

12:42.380 --> 12:44.460
He walks a road to darkness.

12:44.460 --> 12:48.210
And who can say what lies at the end
of the hopeless goal he seeks?

12:48.920 --> 12:50.960
You must never forget.

12:50.960 --> 12:54.670
Hidden inside of the man
who you travel with is the potential

12:54.670 --> 12:56.960
to bring about a great calamity.

12:57.420 --> 12:59.460
Make the right choice.

13:04.080 --> 13:05.500
Whew!

13:05.710 --> 13:07.960
That's the last of the luggage!

13:07.960 --> 13:09.000
Cool!

13:09.420 --> 13:10.960
Now all we need is the Corstag!

13:10.960 --> 13:11.960
Cool!

13:12.460 --> 13:14.750
We don't need three of them, dammit!

13:14.750 --> 13:15.830
Let the rest go!

13:23.000 --> 13:25.540
You could spend a little more time
on the island before you go...

13:25.540 --> 13:28.210
Thank you!
But I'm afraid that we need to get going.

13:28.540 --> 13:30.250
You've done so much for us.

13:30.250 --> 13:32.460
We're forever in your debt.

13:32.460 --> 13:33.380
Thank you.

13:33.380 --> 13:35.540
It was fun for us to have guests around!

13:35.540 --> 13:37.630
You're welcome to come back anytime!

13:37.790 --> 13:40.830
The box you see there can be used to
create propulsion from magic power

13:40.830 --> 13:41.830
with high efficiency.

13:41.830 --> 13:45.380
With Anne onboard, you should be able
to proceed smoothly thanks to that.

13:45.380 --> 13:46.670
However,

13:46.670 --> 13:49.500
be aware that it's an antique that
was dug up from the ruins and refurbished.

13:49.500 --> 13:51.170
So it's possible that it will break.

13:51.170 --> 13:53.130
What should we do if that happens?

13:53.250 --> 13:54.040
You row.

13:54.040 --> 13:55.040
Alrighty!

13:55.670 --> 13:56.830
Great Witch.

13:59.130 --> 14:03.500
Anne, this will become an
invaluable journey for you as well.

14:03.790 --> 14:06.250
You must not lose heart
no matter what happens.

14:10.210 --> 14:11.460
Annie!

14:14.170 --> 14:17.630
Thanks for everything, fuzzba-
I mean, Piwi.

14:17.790 --> 14:19.880
I'm gonna miss you.

14:23.330 --> 14:26.380
I'm sure we'll meet again someday.
You take care.

14:26.380 --> 14:27.380
'Kay.

14:27.790 --> 14:29.540
All right! It's time to depart!

14:34.040 --> 14:35.250
Goodbye!
Be careful!<b></b>

14:35.250 --> 14:36.040
Safe travels!

14:36.250 --> 14:38.710
Thanks, yo! Thanks, yo!

14:46.000 --> 14:49.170
Shall those flames become a blade
that hurts thine friends?

14:49.170 --> 14:52.500
Or shall they illuminate
the path through the darkness?

14:53.080 --> 14:56.000
This is surely going to be
a cruel and taxing battle,

14:56.000 --> 14:58.670
but I have confidence
that you can overcome it.

14:59.000 --> 15:00.330
Stand firm.

15:05.920 --> 15:09.170
The Great Witch
looked kinda similar to you, huh?

15:09.170 --> 15:09.920
Yes.

15:10.500 --> 15:12.380
She wouldn't tell me anything,

15:12.380 --> 15:14.290
but I suspect that she
once belonged to the Empire.

15:14.290 --> 15:15.630
What? Really?

15:16.080 --> 15:18.460
If my hunch is right, yeah.

15:18.750 --> 15:21.330
But we have more important things
to be focused on right now!

15:21.330 --> 15:23.630
Sailing the sea is different
from being on land like we're used to.

15:23.630 --> 15:25.670
Yeah, I'll be careful!

15:25.960 --> 15:27.670
We're gonna make it back for sure!

15:36.710 --> 15:39.330
We keep going and going,
but it's nothing but more ocean.

15:39.710 --> 15:42.380
I'm starting to worry
if the continent is really out there...

15:42.630 --> 15:44.250
Maybe this one is edible.

15:48.750 --> 15:52.420
I wonder if I'm the only one
who gets anxious being out at sea.

16:00.170 --> 16:02.380
STOP RIGHT THERE! YOU FUZZBALL!

16:03.420 --> 16:04.630
Annie!

16:05.000 --> 16:07.330
Piwi! What do think you're doing?!

16:07.330 --> 16:08.670
I'm leaving the island!

16:08.670 --> 16:11.710
No, you're not! Why are you on our ship?!

16:12.670 --> 16:14.920
Guess what? I'm coming with you!

16:14.920 --> 16:17.920
Are you crazy?!
We're on a very dangerous journey!

16:17.920 --> 16:19.670
This isn't a fishing trip!

16:19.670 --> 16:20.380
Yep!

16:20.380 --> 16:23.250
Don't give me that!
You can't come, dammit!

16:23.580 --> 16:24.500
Huh?

16:24.670 --> 16:26.250
What is that, Piwi?

16:26.250 --> 16:27.750
It's for you, Annie!

16:27.750 --> 16:30.630
Well, now! I spy a familiar face!

16:30.630 --> 16:31.460
Helck!

16:32.500 --> 16:33.710
A letter?
Guess what? I'm coming with you!<b></b>

16:33.710 --> 16:34.460
Guess what? I'm coming with you!

16:34.460 --> 16:35.080
You should take Piwi with you.

16:35.080 --> 16:35.830
Oh yeah?
You should take Piwi with you.<b></b>

16:35.830 --> 16:36.500
Yeah!
You should take Piwi with you.<b></b>

16:36.500 --> 16:38.830
The little one is more than used to danger
after accompanying me

16:38.830 --> 16:40.580
on many expeditions to the ruins.

16:40.580 --> 16:42.290
Contrary to appearances,

16:42.290 --> 16:44.420
Piwi has a very durable body
and won't die easily.

16:47.960 --> 16:49.960
You're a little too uptight.

16:49.960 --> 16:53.290
Take the chance to relax by giving
Piwi's tummy a good rub from time to time.

16:53.290 --> 16:55.500
It's fluffy enough to make
all your worries melt away.

16:55.500 --> 16:56.830
Signed, the Witch.

16:56.830 --> 16:58.460
She can't be serious...

16:58.460 --> 17:00.210
It was hard to make up my mind!

17:00.210 --> 17:02.500
But I wanna see
what it's like outside the island!

17:02.500 --> 17:04.880
So I decided that
I'm going with you guys!

17:04.880 --> 17:06.750
Thanks for having me!

17:06.750 --> 17:08.540
Sounds good! Welcome aboard, Piwi!

17:08.540 --> 17:10.130
OH, CUT THE CRAP!

17:10.130 --> 17:11.290
Turn us around!

17:11.630 --> 17:13.000
Huh? But why?

17:13.000 --> 17:14.250
Isn't that obvious?!

17:14.250 --> 17:16.380
We can't bring Piwi along
on such a perilous journey!

17:16.580 --> 17:19.420
There's still time to turn around!
We're going back to the island!

17:30.790 --> 17:32.540
It's trying to destroy our ship!

17:32.710 --> 17:33.500
I've got this!

17:33.500 --> 17:34.580
Don't you dare!

17:34.580 --> 17:36.290
We're doomed if the ship
gets destroyed here!

17:36.290 --> 17:38.000
Our best option is to run without fighting!

17:44.880 --> 17:47.170
We should be far away enough now...

17:47.330 --> 17:48.710
That really surprised me.

17:48.710 --> 17:51.250
Who knew there were such
big creatures out here?

17:51.540 --> 17:53.250
The sea sure is scary, huh!

17:53.250 --> 17:55.420
Exactly!
So you have to go back to the island!

17:55.420 --> 17:56.330
Cheep.

17:56.330 --> 17:58.790
Don't you "cheep" at me!
What does that even mean?!

17:58.790 --> 17:59.960
Just calm down.

17:59.960 --> 18:03.170
We've already come pretty far out.
Let's just take Piwi with us!

18:03.460 --> 18:06.380
It should be no problem for me
to keep the little fella safe!

18:09.080 --> 18:12.080
I really wish I knew what
the Great Witch was thinking.

18:12.960 --> 18:14.580
You're a little too uptight.

18:14.580 --> 18:17.790
Take the chance to relax by giving
Piwi's tummy a good rub from time to time.

18:17.790 --> 18:20.290
It's fluffy enough to make
all your worries melt away.

18:21.920 --> 18:23.170
Fine then.

18:23.330 --> 18:24.750
But depending on how things go,

18:24.750 --> 18:27.290
we might have to leave Piwi behind
in a safe place, okay?

18:27.290 --> 18:28.210
Cheep!

18:28.210 --> 18:29.960
Thanks, Annie!

18:30.630 --> 18:33.580
Thanks for having me!

18:48.710 --> 18:50.000
Look at the fog.

18:50.750 --> 18:53.750
This must be the troublesome area
that the Great Witch told us about.

18:54.130 --> 18:56.130
But it feels like we can make our way
through here

18:56.130 --> 18:58.210
with no problem
by just going straight ahead.

18:58.210 --> 18:59.210
True.

18:59.210 --> 19:02.080
But we should still do as instructed
and let the Corstag loose in the water.

19:02.080 --> 19:03.250
Okay.

19:07.290 --> 19:08.580
Do your thing!

19:11.790 --> 19:14.290
Not the kind of noise
I expected you to make...

19:16.290 --> 19:18.630
What? You're going back the way we came?

19:19.960 --> 19:24.040
Does that mean we somehow got turned
totally around without even realizing it?

19:37.290 --> 19:38.540
I see ruins.

19:38.750 --> 19:41.500
Civilization existed
even all the way out here, huh?

19:41.920 --> 19:45.630
It seems like the Corstag is definitely
taking us in the right direction.

19:45.790 --> 19:46.960
Way to go!

20:06.880 --> 20:08.250
Thanks for waiting!

20:11.170 --> 20:15.170
Why does the food always taste better
when Helck is the one who makes it?!

20:33.540 --> 20:35.460
Storms at sea are so intense!

20:35.460 --> 20:36.210
Anne!

20:36.210 --> 20:38.130
We can't have you going overboard!
Grab this rope!

20:38.130 --> 20:39.210
I appreciate it!

20:39.580 --> 20:40.710
There's a whirlpool.

20:40.710 --> 20:41.540
A whirlpool?

20:45.330 --> 20:47.920
The pull is so strong
we're being sucked right in!

20:48.080 --> 20:49.500
I've got this!

20:49.500 --> 20:51.830
Hold your horses!
What do think you're doing?!

20:51.830 --> 20:53.580
You can't trifle with
the power of Mother Nature!

20:57.080 --> 20:58.210
Everything's fine.

20:58.210 --> 21:00.830
It might have a strong pull,
but we can break free from it.

21:04.000 --> 21:06.000
Dammit! Talk about bad timing!

21:09.000 --> 21:12.250
Curse that infernal monster!
It must have followed us here!

21:13.080 --> 21:14.670
I've got this.

21:19.710 --> 21:22.500
Yakusoku suru yo

21:22.500 --> 21:25.460
Itsuka sekai ga

21:25.460 --> 21:27.540
Owaru toki mata

21:27.540 --> 21:30.170
Deaemasu you ni

21:42.250 --> 21:47.630
Hana no you na hito datta to

21:47.630 --> 21:53.540
Dareka ga chiisaku tsubuyaiteita

21:53.540 --> 21:59.080
Mizu no nai heya soredemo tashika ni

21:59.080 --> 22:01.580
Asu e saiteita

22:03.290 --> 22:06.080
Zenbu yume dattara

22:06.080 --> 22:08.960
Kimi o shiru koto mo

22:08.960 --> 22:11.880
Koi o suru koto mo

22:11.880 --> 22:15.380
Ikiru imi sae shirazu ni

22:16.210 --> 22:19.000
Tatoeba asu ga

22:19.000 --> 22:21.710
Donna ame demo

22:21.710 --> 22:24.080
Yoru wa ake sekai ni

22:24.080 --> 22:27.170
Niji ga kakaru you ni

22:27.540 --> 22:30.250
Mune no itami mo

22:30.250 --> 22:33.130
Tsutau namida mo

22:33.130 --> 22:36.580
Mirai e no tane ni kaete

22:36.580 --> 22:38.210
Ikiyou

22:38.920 --> 22:40.960
Bukiyou na ai ga

22:40.960 --> 22:44.130
Hana o sakasu made

22:45.920 --> 22:50.710
<b>Next Episode</b>

22:45.920 --> 22:50.710
<b>Barbarians of the Tothman Tribe</b>

22:46.750 --> 22:47.750
Next time:

22:47.750 --> 22:49.580
"Barbarians of the Tothman Tribe"
